OL,3,GNEWSAIncredible or catastrophic? Jaguar
OL,4,Aunveils its polarising electric car
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo years ago, JLR relaunched Jaguar
OL,7,Finto a blizzard of controversy. Its
OL,8,Fbizarre teaser ad was described as
OL,9,F"woke" and its "Barbie pink" concept
OL,10,Fcar was ridiculed.
OL,12,FNow, the first of its new models has
OL,13,Fappeared in public for the first time.
OL,14,FThe all-electric Type 01, unveiled in
OL,15,FNew York, represents a radical new
OL,16,Fdirection for the classic brand.
OL,18,FThe car itself is an imposing four-door
OL,19,F"Grand Tourer", with a long bonnet that
OL,20,Fdeliberately harks back to Jaguar's
OL,21,Femblematic 1960s E-Type.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
