OL,3,GNEWSAIncredible or catastrophic? Jaguar
OL,4,Aunveils its polarising electric car
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut it marks a gamble for JLR, which
OL,7,Fhas invested billions reinventing
OL,8,FJaguar and is facing mixed reactions
OL,9,Fover the new car's design and the
OL,10,Fbrand's all-electric strategy.
